You asked for it - you got it.

Here are the cursed and blessed percentages.  As you suspected, bad
ones are more likely to be cursed.  As a general rule, once I determine
an amulet is uncursed (using stupid pet trick or whatever), I'll
put it on immediately.  If it's strangulation or restful sleep you
can take it off (hopefully before a monster kills you while you're
sleeping).  Change isn't all that bad.

You'll identify ESP, strangulation, Restful Sleep, or Change fairly
quickly (even reflection might be identified fairly soon).  While 
versus poison doesn't really help if you already have poison resistance, 
the last thing you want is to get killed with an Amulet of Life Saving 
in your possession.  So use your pet (don't wait to find an altar or a 
scroll of identify) to ensure they're uncursed, and put them on.

Amulet Name         % of all random amulets      % cursed   % blessed

ESP                          18%                     5%          5%
Versus Poison                17%                     5%          5%
Strangulation                14%                    90.5%        0.5%
Restful Sleep                14%                    90.5%        0.5%
Change                       14%                    90.5%        0.5%
Life Saving                   8%                     5%          5%
Reflection                    8%                     5%          5%
Magical Breathing             7%                     5%          5%
